pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: badge
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 40, 300, 20]
    content:
      style: "$badge"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>METHODOLOGY</p>
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 65, 900, 40]
    content:
      style: "$pageTitle"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Leakage-Safe Evaluation Harness</strong></p>
  - elementId: divider
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 115, 1160, 0]
    shapeName: straightConnector1
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$midGray"
  - elementId: split-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 130, 600, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Split Protocol</strong></p>
  - elementId: split-timeline-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 170, 1160, 80]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [3000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$lightGray"
  - elementId: split-train
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [80, 185, 260, 50]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [3000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: split-train-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 185, 260, 50]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>train</strong></p>
  - elementId: split-embargo1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [340, 185, 90, 50]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [3000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$secondary"
  - elementId: split-embargo1-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [340, 185, 90, 50]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>embargo</p>
  - elementId: split-valid
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [430, 185, 200, 50]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [3000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: split-valid-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [430, 185, 200, 50]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>valid</strong></p>
  - elementId: split-embargo2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [630, 185, 90, 50]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [3000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$secondary"
  - elementId: split-embargo2-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [630, 185, 90, 50]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>embargo</p>
  - elementId: split-oos
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [720, 185, 480, 50]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [3000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: split-oos-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [720, 185, 480, 50]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>OOS (out-of-sample)</strong></p>
  - elementId: split-arrow1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [340, 235, 90, 0]
    shapeName: straightConnector1
    arrow: [null, "arrow"]
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$darkGray"
  - elementId: split-arrow2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [630, 235, 90, 0]
    shapeName: straightConnector1
    arrow: [null, "arrow"]
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$darkGray"
  - elementId: split-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 255, 1160, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$darkGray"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>Single split date is the source of truth for graph construction, model selection, and gate evaluation.</p>
  - elementId: controls-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 300, 600, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Automated Controls (Asserted in Code)</strong></p>
  - elementId: control-1-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 340, 360, 160]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [3000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$lightGray"
  - elementId: control-1-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [80, 355, 28, 28]
    iconName: "fas:shuffle"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: control-1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [120, 352, 280, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Negative Control</strong></p>
  - elementId: control-1-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 390, 320, 100]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>Shuffle labels per snapshot → validation IC must collapse to zero. If it does not, the pipeline is leaking.</p>
  - elementId: control-2-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [460, 340, 360, 160]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [3000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$lightGray"
  - elementId: control-2-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [480, 355, 28, 28]
    iconName: "fas:seedling"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$secondary"
  - elementId: control-2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [520, 352, 280, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Positive Control</strong></p>
  - elementId: control-2-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [480, 390, 320, 100]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>Plant a synthetic signal (label = standardised feature) → training must recover it. Proves the trainer is not broken.</p>
  - elementId: control-3-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [860, 340, 360, 160]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [3000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$lightGray"
  - elementId: control-3-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [880, 355, 28, 28]
    iconName: "fas:flask"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: control-3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [920, 352, 280, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Convergence Probe</strong></p>
  - elementId: control-3-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [880, 390, 320, 100]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>IC loss recovers planted signal at 0.99 validation IC; MSE plateaus at 0.33. Justifies the IC-loss objective.</p>
  - elementId: bottom-insight
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 520, 1160, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><strong>Key principle:</strong> Controls are structural, not procedural. They run in the test suite on every code change — pure pandas, no GPU needed.</p>
  - elementId: model-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 590, 1160, 70]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$darkGray"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>Model:</strong> 2-layer GAT (PyG) · <strong>Loss:</strong> negative Pearson IC per snapshot · <strong>Selection:</strong> best-by-validation-IC checkpoint · <strong>Modes:</strong> single fit vs walk-forward refits every 63 snapshots</p>
  - elementId: footer-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 680, 1280, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: footer-left
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 685, 600, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>Relational Alpha Factors · GAT Capstone</p>
  - elementId: footer-right
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1100, 685, 120, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>6</p>
